                                "sense_id": "e1061e5f-29ab-360b-b28a-8f09a6d12a78",
                                "text": "The smallest impactor that can penetrate the atmosphere deep enough to cause any damage on the ground is not much smaller than the \"Tunguska\" bolide that flattened a couple thousand square miles of Siberian forest in 1908."
                            }
                        ]
